.snakemake/
work/
# The repository's .gitignore ignores results/ everywhere; this update commits its small
# results (tables, depth, benchmarks, versions, caller info), so re-include them here.
!results/
# Filtered VCFs aren't committed: the final set goes to Zenodo, and the workflow regenerates them.
results/**/*.vcf.gz
results/**/*.vcf.gz.csi
results/**/*.vcf.gz.tmp.vcf.gz
# Default input and tool locations (config/config.yaml), and site-specific paths.
data/
resources/
config/local.yaml
